# SSH public keys baked into the image for the `coder` user.
# One key per line. Lines starting with '#' and blank lines are ignored.
#
# Example:
#   ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAA... you@host
#
# NOTE: keys here are shared by every VM cloned from this image. For per-VM
# keys, inject them at runtime instead (Firecracker MMDS, a config drive, or
# an in-guest agent) rather than baking them in.
